   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Place and destination: w, na and do",
     "texto": [
      "To say **where** we are, we usually use the locative: **w parku**. To say **where to** we are going, we use the accusative with **w/na** or the genitive with **do**: **na pocztę**, **do apteki**.",
      "English usually uses «to» and «at/in»; in Polish the preposition and the case change depending on the verb and the destination."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
